[SPEAKER_00]: Do you know who wrote this?

01:12:58.382 --> 01:13:01.583
[SPEAKER_00]: Is pursuing something incompatible with being good?

01:13:03.803 --> 01:13:04.383
[SPEAKER_00]: Business.

01:13:04.403 --> 01:13:04.604
[SPEAKER_00]: Business.

01:13:04.624 --> 01:13:05.384
[SPEAKER_00]: There you go.

01:13:05.884 --> 01:13:08.785
[SPEAKER_00]: Is pursuing business incompatible with dharma?

01:13:10.105 --> 01:13:12.406
[SPEAKER_01]: Is pursuing

01:13:14.197 --> 01:13:19.699
[SPEAKER_00]: Pursuing business, working with the business world, incompatible with the dharma.

01:13:20.980 --> 01:13:27.922
[SPEAKER_00]: Jambgal.

